{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terminull Brigade Demo is a third-person action-roguelike co-op hero shooter set in futuristic digital worlds.\u00a0  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version is designed to allow you to try out the core gameplay of Terminull Brigade - Experience the game's fast-paced combat with roguelike elements through a selected roster of playable Rogueteers with distinct playstyles and challenge yourself to complete the ever increasing difficulty of the game levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purge, Crash, and ReRun.\u00a0 Again.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demo currently only supports single player - Full co-op multiplayer mode will be available at  launch.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Full roster of Rogueteers, additional gameplay modes and progression system are currently locked in the demo.\u00a0 They will be available in the launch version.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demo currently comes in only English and Chinese language.\u00a0 More languages will be supported at launch.\u00a0</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demo currently not available in South Korea region, but will be available at launch.</i> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3662220?t=1749526731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662220/fbf97e590e21d0160a2dd40211a3328ce13c83e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749526731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662220/6cc7e9b700533d010d4bb91095b85c8b91b65030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749526731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662220/6cc7e9b700533